+## Customer-pass exact-offer confirmation — 2026-11-14
+
+Module: Benefits homepage customer checkout pass. Hop: catalog seller/offer
+query → `CustomerCheckoutPass` public seller/rule lookup → current bound pass
+status → challenge → wallet signature → confirm. Each observed selection change
+starts a new lookup generation. With an explicit selection, confirmation requires
+the current lookup to resolve to the bound canonical seller and rule. Clear
+removes selection only and invalidates in-flight confirmation.
+
+The confirmation rechecks the current pass, checkout, wallet, selection, and
+deadline before each action. Equivalent control polls preserve the action.
+`test-benefits-customer-pass-ui.js` adds synthetic delayed responses to the
+existing checkout fixture. Physical wallet and release acceptance are separate.
+
 ## Generic IFRLock guidance versus exact checkout eligibility — 2026-10-29
 
 Module: Benefits homepage customer workspace -> `WalletStatus.tsx` generic balance
